    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Last Pickup&quot; is a survival-adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic world, where players take on the challenge of delivering supplies. Navigate through ruined cities in your vehicle, solve puzzles, overcome obstacles, and make critical deliveries for survival. Running out of fuel or losing cargo will take you back to the last checkpoint, requiring careful driving and decision-making. Experience the thrill of racing and the tension of an apocalypse all in one game!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Last Pickup&quot; is a survival-adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic world, where players take on the challenge of delivering supplies. Navigate through ruined cities in your vehicle, solve puzzles, overcome obstacles, and make critical deliveries for survival. Running out of fuel or losing cargo will take you back to the last checkpoint, requiring careful driving and decision-making. Experience the thrill of racing and the tension of an apocalypse all in one game!</p>",
    "short_description": "In &quot;Last Pickup,&quot; players navigate a post-apocalyptic world, carrying fuel to keep their vehicle running and jumping over obstacles in dangerous areas. Be careful not to drop items, as doing so will return you to the last save point.",
